; ETCH: PLANET globe + logo art
; generated by emitter.py
; SHALLOW ETCH PASS -- does not cut through, orientation/decorative mark only
; etch power/feed: 100% / 5000mm/min -- UNVERIFIED, scrap-test first (see laser_materials.yaml)
; 50 strokes
; chain order: nearest-safe (min separation = half each chain's own wiggle lead-in, 41.67mm) -- keeps consecutive laser-off/on events apart enough to avoid residual-heat bias, without a farthest-first travel penalty
; power mode: M3 (static); strokes simplified 0.05mm, min segment 0.3mm
; warmup: linear model, 1000ms = 83.33mm at F5000 (100% of the 1000ms full-power ramp) -- closed loops follow through past the start (laps until warm), open strokes ping-pong over themselves first
; strokes fitted to G2/G3 arcs within 0.05mm (quickcut/arcfit.py)
